{
  "body": "Retire DES-SR-14/23 feature/proof operation and VAL-SR-28 accepted grammar; revise DIST-SR-24 resource population to compact-core; CLI-SR-32 withdraws spec discovery/config kind. Preserve source reading/adoption authority, compact reasoning, current model/catalog safety, other CLI locations and all stored-record/installation contracts. AUTH-SH-005 makes the changed Authoring boundary concrete without claiming execution. Other catalog groups retain their current boundary and resource integrity. Repeated model-introduction statements are reconciled consumers, not independent new responsibilities. All changed Design subjects and complete Skill/Authoring package references are handed to independent Design Review. No old approval is retargeted; current-model/prose/catalog checks passed; implementation and Delivery remain separate.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-17-retire-feature-format-support",
